# AddressSanitizer suppression file
#
# Suppressions for known false positives in third-party code and system
# libraries. Each entry names a specific interceptor or call-stack pattern
# that ASan should not report.
#
# Format: one interceptor name per line, optionally preceded by a
# stack-frame pattern (see https://clang.llvm.org/docs/AddressSanitizer.html#suppressing-reports)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GLFW / OpenGL driver stack (known leak on context creation/destruction)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
leak:glfw
leak:libGL

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# JoltPhysics internal allocations (managed by its own allocator)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
leak:Jolt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# System / CRT startup
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
interceptor_via_fun:__interceptor_malloc
